 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? It' a lovely language to learn through dreams. Many common expressions translate nicely, like dreaming of home means missing someone dear. Then it was real language. Your brain is good at recognizing patterns, even when the language is foreign to you. Which ones? Generally, yes. Short bursts of exercise are good for you, so a few minutes here and there are fine. Sure, go ahead. Then immerse yourself in Spanish as much as you can. Listen to music, watch TV, read books. The more you expose yourself, the faster your brain will pick up the patterns.",
